OL,3,GNEWSAPolice helped remove Russell Brand
OL,4,Aafter 'violent incident' at Jemima
OL,5,AGoldsmith's home
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice have confirmed they helped
OL,8,FJemima Goldsmith to get ex-boyfriend
OL,9,FRussell Brand off her property in 2014
OL,10,Fafter she claimed a violent incident
OL,11,Ftook place.
OL,13,FThames Valley Police said officers were
OL,14,Fcontacted by an alleged victim and went
OL,15,Fto an address in Oxfordshire on 25 July
OL,16,F2014 but no arrests were made.
OL,18,FThey listened to her concerns and gave
OL,19,Fsupport, and "also ensured the victim's
OL,20,Fpartner left the address, as per the
OL,21,Fvictim's wishes", the police added in a
OL,22,Fstatement on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
